Copyright 2026 OpenDepth Authors

This source release is derived from the authors' modified Step1X-Edit checkout,
whose upstream Git base is e2261a2fc10dfe1ca5e54496e4319d588576e701.
Upstream: https://github.com/stepfun-ai/Step1X-Edit (Apache-2.0).

Backbone and training utilities retain the upstream implementation and existing
copyright notices, including Black Forest Labs/FLUX and Kohya sd-scripts code.
The Qwen model and pretrained Step1X-Edit weights are obtained separately and
are not included in this repository.

library/jpeg_xl_util.py is derived from Fraetor/jxl_decode (MIT).
Its original license is included in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/jxl_decode-MIT.txt.

Changes in this release: robust discriminative training with feature alignment
and RGB reconstruction; standalone depth inference without the editing demo;
portable train/infer/evaluate entry points; removal of host-specific launchers
and unconditional NumPy monkey patches. The upstream LICENSE is retained.
